  "description": "In the underworld of powerful criminal organizations, a young man struggling to survive sees a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. \n\nTo succeed in this harsh world, there's only one path for outsiders like him: becoming the \"Tail\" — the loyal right-hand man and closest aide — to Medic, the formidable and beautiful broker of the Yonghwangpa (Dragon Emperor Clan).\n\nWhat starts as a desperate bid for success and survival quickly turns into a dangerous game filled with ambition, loyalty, betrayal, and power struggles in the criminal underworld.",
